{"title":"Entire","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>An <b>entire function</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Function\" title=\"Function\">function</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/f/32f1ab8f51a22b3314bef81d856b1e5237ffb011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\mathbb{C}\\to\\mathbb{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" /> that is <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Holomorphic\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Holomorphic\">holomorphic</a> on the full <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Complex_plane\" title=\"Complex plane\">complex plane</a>.\n<i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Entire&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018083515\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 259/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 195/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.792      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.792      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2125:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018083515 and revision id 31005. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}